# Sonic Championship
#
# Already ships set to COUNTRY: USA. The default is captured anyway so a
# first boot starts from initialised backup RAM rather than announcing that
# it is broken.
#
# Drives the game's own test menu, because that is the only supported way to
# change a setting these boards keep in battery-backed RAM. Regenerate with:
#
#     tools/make-defaults.sh schamp
run 700
testmenu 60
run 150
# Leaving the menus properly is what makes some of these games commit
# the change to backup RAM.
run 400
nvram defaults
